<title>UK: Parts of south England may see 6-8 cms of snow.</title>
<headline>Parts of south England may see 6-8 cms of snow.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Some areas of southern England around London can expect six to eight cms of snow on Thursday, the Met Office said.</p>
<p>Other areas will be covered with at least one to two cms as the current weather system moves west.</p>
<p>The snow is likely to continue through the afternooon and black ice will add to driving problems.</p>
</text>
